WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
It is your number for working and paying contributions. You apply online if you live in the UK and have the right to work. It takes up to 4 weeks. You can start work before you have it if you prove your right to work.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.700
If you have an eVisa or had a BRP, you may already have one: check your UKVI account.

3
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:40.700
BRPs (residence permit cards) have been replaced by eVisas. Your eVisa is in your UKVI account, which is free. For travel, the eVisa is linked to your passport: keep the document in your account up to date.

4
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:56.700
To prove your status (work, renting) you use a share code. Bank: ask about a «basic bank account» and bring your passport; if you do not have bills yet, ask what other proof of address they accept.

5
00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:03.900
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
